        "procedure": "Under dry N2 (Schlenk/glovebox), a toluene solution (10 mL) of 2H2 (0.29 g, 1.0 mmol) was slowly added to a toluene solution (10 mL) of Sm[N(SiMe3)2]3 (0.63 g, 1.0 mmol) with stirring at room temperature. The mixture was refluxed overnight to give a yellow solution, filtered, and concentrated to about 5 mL. After standing at room temperature for three days, yellow crystals of 6·0.5C7H8 were isolated.",
